' State Diagram 06 — greedy-head and asynchronous-frontier composition.
'
' The head lane follows one maximum-score child at a time. The frontier lane may
' expand any scored nonterminal, retaining every terminal and deduplicating shared
' children. Both require height progress. Composition reserves index zero for the
' greedy head and totally orders only the remaining terminals.
'
' Rocq Rank.rank_terminates ; the empty-tips case is a typed Err
' (Bound.empty_tips_typed_err).
'
' Render:
'   plantuml -tsvg docs/theory/fork-choice/diagrams/06-state-rank-fixpoint.puml

@startuml 06-state-rank-fixpoint
!theme plain

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor  #FFFFFF
  BorderColor      #333333
  ArrowColor       #444444
  FontName         "monospace"
  FontSize         10
}
skinparam legendFontName "monospace"
skinparam legendFontSize 10
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam legendBorderColor #666666
skinparam defaultFontName "monospace"
skinparam defaultFontSize 10

title LMD-GHOST two-lane ranking (parallel-preserving)

' State color legend:
'   blue   (#BBDEFB) = seed frontier {lca}
'   orange (#FFE0B2) = expand-and-sort frontier (one level)
'   green  (#A5D6A7) = fixpoint reached (accepting)
' Edge color legend:
'   teal  (#00838F) = initial descent
'   blue  (#1565C0) = progress step (measure strictly increases)
'   orange(#E65100) = leaf guard (block keeps self)
'   green (#2E7D32) = fixpoint transition

state "certified LCA" as Seed #BBDEFB
state "greedy lane\nchoose score-DESC/hash-ASC child\nuntil a terminal" as Greedy #A5D6A7
state "frontier lane\nchoose ANY scored nonterminal;\nreplace by all children; deduplicate" as Expand #FFE0B2
state "compose\n[ghost] ++ sort(terminals - ghost)" as Fix #A5D6A7

[*] -[#00838F]-> Seed
Seed -[#2E7D32]-> Greedy : start head = lca
Seed -[#00838F]-> Expand : frontier = {lca}
Greedy -[#2E7D32]-> Greedy : scored children exist ⟹\nchoose unique best; height advances
Expand -[#1565C0]-> Expand : scored nonterminal exists ⟹\nexpand any one; finite work decreases
Greedy -[#2E7D32]-> Fix : no scored child ⟹ ghost terminal
Expand -[#2E7D32]-> Fix : exact terminal frontier reached
Fix -[#2E7D32]-> [*] : return tips

note bottom of Fix
  Rocq proves greedy termination, exact frontier membership, confluence, and
  head-first composition. TLA⁺ explores every asynchronous expansion order.
  A malformed non-advancing child or missing head membership is a typed error.
end note

@enduml
